---
title: Blog
description: Essays, rants, reflections, and random brain droppings from Shira.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<section class="hero compact-hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1 class="site-headline">Writing</h1><p class="site-description">Essays, rants, reflections, and whatever thought refuses to leave quietly.</p></div></section>
<main class="posts-container">
{% for post in collections.posts %}
<article class="post-card"><div class="post-card-content">
  <div class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></div>
  <h2 class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
  <div class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.description or post.content | striptags | truncate(260) }}</div>
  <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more">readMore() <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
</div></article>
{% endfor %}
</main>
